Product names

The product names in this dataset are real dm-drogerie markt products, taken
from the publicly accessible product search on dm.de. No trademark rights are
granted by this License (see section 6 of the License).

Everything else in the dataset — suppliers, warehouses, regions, buyers, teams,
purchase prices, calorie values, stock levels, and every gold answer — is
invented and generated deterministically from a seed, and corresponds to no real
company, location, person, or commercial figure.

